@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Financial Disclaimer";
}

<div class="legal-page">
    <h1 class="legal-page__title">Financial Disclaimer</h1>
    <p class="text-muted">Last updated: October 2026</p>

    <div class="alert alert-warning legal-notice">
        <strong>Not Financial Advice:</strong> PersonalFinance is a tool for tracking and organizing your personal financial data. Nothing in this Service constitutes financial, investment, tax, or legal advice.
    </div>

    <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>No Financial Advice</h2>
        <p>PersonalFinance provides tools for budget tracking, net worth projection, savings goals, and financial analysis. All calculations, projections, and recommendations generated by the Service are for informational and educational purposes only.</p>
        <p>The Service does not provide personalized financial advice, investment recommendations, or tax guidance. You should consult a qualified financial advisor before making any financial decisions.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>Your Responsibility</h2>
        <p>You are solely responsible for your financial decisions. Any actions you take based on information from the Service are at your own risk. We are not liable for any financial losses, missed opportunities, or other damages resulting from your use of the Service.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>Projections Are Estimates</h2>
        <p>Net worth projections, savings goal timelines, and investment calculations are based on the inputs you provide and assumed rates of return. Actual results may differ significantly due to market conditions, inflation, taxes, fees, and other factors not accounted for in our models.</p>
        <p>Past performance of any investment is not indicative of future results.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>Data Accuracy</h2>
        <p>The accuracy of any output from the Service depends on the accuracy of the data you enter. We do not verify the correctness of your financial data. Errors in input will lead to errors in output.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>Third-Party Data</h2>
        <p>If you import data from Google Drive or other third-party sources, the accuracy of that data is your responsibility. We do not validate or guarantee the correctness of imported data.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>Consult a Professional</h2>
        <p>For personalized financial planning, investment advice, or tax guidance, please consult a qualified financial professional who can consider your individual circumstances.</p>
    </section>
</div>
